  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "*\tAdded support for ITU-T E.164 telecommunication standards (#55)\n*\tAdded Azure Artifacts badges for additional DataStandardizer packages (#54)\n*\tRefactor pipeline configuration to remove redundant .NET installation tasks (#47)\n*\tRemoved redundant XML documentation comments from ISO 3166-2 subdivision files (#46)\n*\tAdd DOS Date/Time Support to Chronology Package (#49)\n*\tAdd Julian Day Number and Unix Time utilities with tests (#48)\n*\tEnhanced ISO 3166-2 Subdivision Code Generation Script (#45)\n*\tRefactored documentation for improved clarity and structure (#43)\n*\tAdded UseDotNet@2 task to CI pipeline for .NET Core SDK management (#44)\n*\tAdded support for .NET 10.0 across all projects and tests (#42)\n*\tUpdated project dependencies and test configurations (#41)\n*\tUpdated project files to disable source revision inclusion in informational version (#40)\n*\tAdded CSV File Support to DataStandardizer (#39)\n*\tUpdate read-csv-files.md (#38)\n*\tUpdated README with project documentation link (#37)\n*\tAdded comprehensive user guides for Data Standardizer packages (#36)\n*\tEnhanced CSV File Support in DataStandardizer.File (#35)\n*\tAdd new projects for language, geography, and language tag support (#34)\n*\tdocs: Add DataStandardizer.File package details to README (#33)\n*\tdocs: Update project metadata for DataStandardizer.File (#30)\n*\tfeat: Add DataStandardizer.File project for CSV file handling (#29)\n*\tdocs: add support section to README (#28)\n*\tCreate FUNDING.yml (#27)\n*\tdocs: Update README with improved package descriptions and release table (#26)\n*\tdocs: Update README to include DataStandardizer.Chronology (#23)\n*\tfeat: Add DataStandardizer.Chronology project and tests (#22)\n*\tfeat: Rename enum and related types to follow naming convention. (#18)\n*\tEnhance CI pipeline for package version handling (#15)\n*\tFix defect in PS script for \"Set version arguments\" CI pipeline step. (#14)\n*\t#4335: Added money data type. (#8)\n*\tfix: Update logging behavior in CI pipeline for package versioning (#11)\n*\tfix: Enhance CI pipeline logic for package versioning and branch handling (#10)\n*\tCorrected versioning of packages built and their dependencies (#9)\n*\tApply package versioning to all projects in the solution for CI build pipeline. (#7)\n*\tUpdate `Iso4217Current` enum to codes list published on 2025-05-12. (#5)\n*\tFix warning message produced by PublishSymbols task in CI pipeline. (#2)\n*\tProtect access to string enum constructors with non-public scope. (#1)",
